<section class="rsb-section rsb-section--gray">
  <div class="rsb-container">
    <div class="rsb-section__head">
      <span class="rsb-eyebrow">Industry Challenges</span>
      <h2>4 common noise-barrier pain points we solve for your project</h2>
      <div class="rsb-divider rsb-divider--center"></div>
      <p>From highway infrastructure to solar farm developers, project teams worldwide face the same four challenges when sourcing acoustic barriers & sound walls. Yukings products and engineering services are purpose-built to resolve them.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rsb-split" style="grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px">
      <div class="rsb-split__media"><div class="rsb-split__img" style="background-image:url('img/rusted-old-noise-barrier-failed-corrosion-urban-highway-03fe352d.webp')"></div></div>
      <div class="rsb-split__body">
        <span class="rsb-split__eyebrow">Why projects fail</span>
        <h2>Generic, un-tested suppliers can cost your project dearly.</h2>
        <div class="rsb-grid rsb-grid--2" style="margin:24px 0 28px">
          <div class="rsb-card">
            <div class="rsb-card__body" style="padding:18px 20px;border-left:3px solid #d94545">
              <span style="display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#d94545;letter-spacing:1.2px;margin-bottom:8px">01 · PERFORMANCE</span>
              <h3 style="font-size:15.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text-primary);margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1.35">Under-performing acoustic panels</h3>
              <p style="font-size:13.5px;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.6">Low-cost, un-tested barrier panels that barely reach 20 dB insertion loss &mdash; missing regulatory targets, producing post-installation complaints and costly retrofit.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rsb-card">
            <div class="rsb-card__body" style="padding:18px 20px;border-left:3px solid #d94545">
              <span style="display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#d94545;letter-spacing:1.2px;margin-bottom:8px">02 · LIFESPAN</span>
              <h3 style="font-size:15.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text-primary);margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1.35">Corrosion & short product lifespan</h3>
              <p style="font-size:13.5px;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.6">Thin metal gauges, poor galvanizing and no UV protection lead to rust, coating failure and structural degradation in 3&ndash;5 years &mdash; well below the intended design life.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rsb-card">
            <div class="rsb-card__body" style="padding:18px 20px;border-left:3px solid #d94545">
              <span style="display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#d94545;letter-spacing:1.2px;margin-bottom:8px">03 · ENGINEERING</span>
              <h3 style="font-size:15.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text-primary);margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1.35">No engineering or simulation support</h3>
              <p style="font-size:13.5px;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.6">Suppliers offering &ldquo;off-the-shelf&rdquo; panels without acoustic simulation, structural calculations or BIM integration leave consultants blind to real-world performance.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rsb-card">
            <div class="rsb-card__body" style="padding:18px 20px;border-left:3px solid #d94545">
              <span style="display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#d94545;letter-spacing:1.2px;margin-bottom:8px">04 · DELIVERY</span>
              <h3 style="font-size:15.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text-primary);margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1.35">Unreliable supply & long lead times</h3>
              <p style="font-size:13.5px;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.6">Small fabricators with limited capacity struggle with large orders, custom projects and export logistics &mdash; delayed delivery, inconsistent quality, missing documents.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>Yukings solves these problems with a vertically-integrated 42,000 m&sup2; factory, a dedicated engineering team, full CE and ISO certification, and 18+ years of export experience.</p>
        <div class="rsb-split__actions"><a href="/contact/#inquiry" class="rsb-btn rsb-btn--primary">Request a Project Review</a><a href="/about/#tab-certifications" class="rsb-btn rsb-btn--ghost">View Certifications</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="rsb-section">
